SUMMARY:CLAIR-INTUITION: A 6-Week Virtual Intuition Mentorship (by applica
 tion only!)
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**\\*\\*\\*Read details & apply here --> 
 [INFO & APP](robynmichelle.co/clair-intuition)\\*\\*\\***\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\n\n✨ **CLAIR-INTUITION**\n***A 6-Week Virtual Intuition Mentorshi
 p***\n\nWhat if your intuition isn’t something you need to “learn” -
 \nbut something you’re already experiencing… and just don’t fully tr
 ust yet?\n\nThis small-group mentorship is designed to help you move from 
 **second-guessing → trusting your intuition** in a grounded\, supportive
  space.\n\nOver six weeks\, you’ll explore how your intuition naturally 
 communicates with you (through the “clairs”) and learn practical tools
  to recognize\, interpret\, and trust what you’re already receiving.\n\n
 This is not about being “gifted” or performing.\nIt’s about reconnec
 ting with a natural human capacity - at your own pace.\n\n🌿 **What to e
 xpect:**\n\\- Guided meditations \\+ experiential exercises\n\\- Tools to 
 understand your intuitive language\n\\- Practice reading and sensing energ
 y\n\\- A grounded\\\, heart\\-centered approach \\(no pressure to perform\
 \)\n\\- Supportive small group \\(limited to 8 participants\\)\n\n🌟 **T
 his is for you if:**\n\\- You second\\-guess your intuition and want to tr
 ust it more\n\\- You’ve had intuitive moments but don’t know how to wo
 rk with them\n\\- You want a grounded\\\, non\\-judgmental space to explor
 e\n\\- You’re a healer\\\, coach\\\, space holder\\\, creative\\\, or si
 mply curious\n\\- You’re craving community while developing your intuiti
 on\n\n💫 **Details:**\n\\- Wednesdays · 10:30am ET \\(Virtual on Zoom\\
 )\n\\- Starts May 13\n\\- 6 weeks\n\\- All levels welcome \\- no experienc
 e needed\n\\- Limited to 8 participants\n\n*By the end of this journey\, y
 ou’ll understand how your intuition communicates with you - and have pra
 ctical tools to **trust it\, interpret it\, and use it in everyday life.**
 *\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Read details & apply here --> [INFO & APP
 ](robynmichelle.co/clair-intuition)\\*\\*\\***
