SUMMARY:The Sacred Dimension of the Stage: How to Step In and Own Your Spa
 ce
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nWe live our lives across many dimensions
 —from the quiet sanctuary of our inner thoughts to the vibrant energy of
  the natural world. But there is a unique\, sacred dimension that opens up
  the moment you step onto a stage.\n\nIn this workshop\, singer and perfor
 mer Fairlight Moriah invites you to shift your perspective on what it mean
 s to perform. You’ll learn how to treat the stage not as a place of judg
 ment\, but as a playground of presence.\n\nBy tapping into your unique inn
 er magic\, you will learn how to command any room\, quiet the noise of sel
 f-doubt\, and truly own your stage.\n\nWhether you are a musician\, speake
 r\, or looking to bring more presence to your daily life\, join us to disc
 over the power of your own dimension.\n\nClass will be held at: Energetic 
 Experiences 81 Weaverville Rd Suite 2\, Asheville\, NC 28804\nWednesday\, 
 May 27th from 5:30pm-7:30pm.\nTickets are $60 and available for up to 20 p
 eople to attend per class.\n\nFor questions or more information\, please c
 ontact Fairlight via text or email at: (828) 367-9693 or [airyfairytarot@g
 mail.com](mailto:airyfairytarot@gmail.com)\n\nMay 27th sign up link:\n[htt
 ps://calendly.com/airyfairytarot/the-sacred-dimension-of-the-stage](https:
 //calendly.com/airyfairytarot/the-sacred-dimension-of-the-stage)
