DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin Jenn & Vi Thursday mornings from\n10
 :30 am -11:30 am\nAll of April and May as we travel around the US.\n\nWe w
 ill meet on our mats and drop into gentle beginner friendly flows to kick 
